# T-276 / DEF-305 — the monthly fiscal-period coverage top-up. INSTALL INSTRUCTIONS: docs/ops/README.md
#
# ⛔ Runs as a `system` principal, per org, with no session and no person. T-140's decision,
# unchanged: a service account holding an admin role is a standing credential nobody watches.
#
# ⭐ What it is for: an org is seeded 12 months of fiscal periods once, at bootstrap, and never
# again — an org running past its first year eventually reaches a month `postEntry` has no period
# for, and every post that month is refused. This job keeps every org's coverage 12 months ahead
# and backfills (option (c)) any month that already elapsed with none, reporting the gap rather
# than letting the next post discover it.

[Unit]
Description=Shareat — monthly fiscal-period coverage top-up, per org (T-276 / DEF-305)
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target
# No After=postgresql.service — the database is DO Managed Postgres, off-box (ADR-002 §1).

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/srv/shareat
ExecStart=/usr/bin/npm run fiscal-period-seed
User=shareat
Group=shareat

# ⚠️ NEVER build here. This is a 2 GB droplet; a build OOMs it. This unit runs an
# already-installed tree shipped by CI — bible §2.10.
Environment=NODE_ENV=production

# ⭐ The exit code is load-bearing: non-zero when anything failed, so the host's mailer speaks up.
StandardOutput=append:/var/log/shareat/fiscal-period-seed.log
StandardError=append:/var/log/shareat/fiscal-period-seed.log
